# Justified exceptions to script/check-upstream's rules; see docs/upstream-sync.md.
#
# Each line: <path or glob> [hunk=N] [added=N] [removed=N] [unmarked=N] [any] # <reason>
#   hunk=N     raises the most lines one hunk may add for matching files
#   added=N    raises the most lines matching files may add
#   removed=N  raises the most lines matching files may remove
#   unmarked=N lets that many hunks add lines that don't name `fast`
#   any        allows any change, including adding or removing the file
# The first matching line applies. Keep entries few and the reasons specific.

